    costRange:  'Call for wedding pricing &mdash; (316) 303-6195',
    intro:      'Diamond Springs Ranch is one of the most distinctive wedding venues in the Wichita area. With outdoor capacity for 300 and indoor for 200, an open catering policy, and the option for a horseback entrance, it&rsquo;s a setting that creates a wedding people actually remember. The 3-story lodge with 30-foot ceilings and the wide-open ranch land combine into a backdrop that no hotel ballroom can touch.',
    body:       '<p>Getting married at Diamond Springs Ranch means choosing a venue that has genuine character &mdash; a working Western ranch with horses in the pasture, open Kansas land in every direction, and a 3-story lodge with 30-foot ceilings that creates an atmosphere hotels and event centers can&rsquo;t manufacture. The ranch offers both outdoor and indoor event space, with outdoor capacity for 300 guests and indoor capacity for 200.</p><h2>A Horseback Entrance. Open Catering. Open Bar.</h2><p>Diamond Springs Ranch allows couples to arrive on horseback for a ceremony entrance unlike anything else available in the Wichita area. The ranch operates an open catering policy &mdash; bring your preferred caterer, no exclusivity. The Rusty Saddle Bar is on site for receptions. For couples who want every element of the day to feel personal and non-generic, the ranch delivers.</p><h2>Why Choose Diamond Springs Ranch for Your Wichita-Area Wedding?</h2><p>The ranch has hosted 30+ weddings over the past five years. The combination of authentic Western atmosphere, flexible indoor/outdoor space, an open catering policy, and overnight accommodation (the treehouse and covered wagon) for the wedding couple makes Diamond Springs Ranch the only venue in the region that offers all of these together.</p><p>Contact Logan at (316) 303-6195 to check your date and talk through the vision. Spring and fall dates book months in advance.</p><h2>Real Photos from Ranch Weddings</h2><p>The wedding photography that comes out of Diamond Springs Ranch doesn&rsquo;t look like any other Wichita-area wedding. The Highland cattle, the horses, the open Kansas sky at sunset, and the lodge interior all create images that couples reference for years. Bring your photographer &mdash; the location does the work.</p><p>Explore more experiences at Diamond Springs Ranch: <a href="/guided-horseback-rides/">Guided Horseback Rides</a>, <a href="/luxury-treehouse-stay/">Luxury Treehouse Stay</a>, <a href="/covered-wagon-stay/">Covered Wagon Stay</a>, <a href="/private-events/">Private Events &amp; Rentals</a>. View our full <a href="/services/">ranch experiences</a>.</p>',
